puls-diskinfo (1.1.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * New release.
  * Added LVM/LUKS mapping resolution support.
  * Safer benchmarking directory security bounds check.
  * Added new drive fields: device path, wear level, unsafe shutdowns, read ahead, scheduler, write cache, trim.
  * Display decimal values next to hexadecimal in SMART table.
  * Completely resolved contrast bug and whity hover overlay on cards.

 -- Barın Güzeldemirci <baringuzeldemir@gmail.com>  Fri, 26 Jun 2026 00:10:00 +0300

puls-diskinfo (1.0.0-1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * GTK4-based disk health monitoring application.
  * S.M.A.R.T. attribute display for ATA/SATA drives.
  * NVMe health information support.
  * Temperature monitoring with visual gauges.
  * Health status indicators (Good/Caution/Bad).
  * Support for HDD, SATA SSD, NVMe SSD, USB drives.
  * Polkit-based privilege escalation for SMART data reading.

 -- Barın Güzeldemirci <baringuzeldemir@gmail.com>  Fri, 12 Jun 2026 15:20:00 +0300
